        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Chest tightness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Yesterday afternoon, central dull pressure and slight heaviness extending into the left upper arm while walking the dog. Gradual onset over approximately 5–10 minutes; lasted approximately 15–20 minutes and resolved with rest. Intermittent exertional symptoms were worse with exertion, such as walking up the driveway, and better with rest."
      }
    },
    {
